sentences.text:
In the above facts and circumstances,
continuation of the criminal proceeding against the petitioners would amount to abuse of the process of the court and as such, the same are liable to be quashed and accordingly, the following;
ORDER Petition filed by the petitioners/accused Nos.2 and 3 under Section 482 of Cr.P.C. is allowed.

